    "result_text": "The test passes. \n\nI implemented the change request \u2014 **\"Contacts need a good email too\"** \u2014 as a full-stack, additive change mirroring the existing client email validation:\n\n1. **Front-end** (`features/clients/feature.tsx`): The `ClientContacts` form now validates the email against the shared `EMAIL_RE` before submitting. On a bad email it shows a `contact-form-email-error` alert and does not POST \u2014 so no `contact-row-*` is created.\n\n2. **Server** (`contact/CreateContact.java`): Added the same regex check that `CreateClient` uses, rejecting bad emails with a `400 BAD_REQUEST` so the API agrees with the UI.\n\n3. **Database** (`db/migration/V10__contacts_email_valid.sql`): A new Flyway migration adding a `contacts_email_valid` CHECK constraint \u2014 the last line of defence, matching the `clients_email_valid` rule.\n\nThe Playwright spec passes (`1 passed`).",
